   "subject": "Re: code separataion",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can do this easily. For a single file put the following in shinyServer in server.R<div><br></div><div><div>source(&#39;extender.R&#39;, local = TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>Note that local = TRUE is required. If you install the R.utils package you can use the following to source all files in a directory:</div><div><br></div><div>sourceDirectory(&#39;tools/&#39;, recursive = TRUE)</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
